WEBVTT

00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:08.420
What is that?

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:13.290
That monster's been evolved
by one of those orbs too, hasn't it?!

00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:19.000
The parasite's attached itself to...
the Corpse Flower, Titan Arum.

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:23.040
That ain't good...

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:24.790
So many Magic Stones...

00:00:25.130 --> 00:00:26.540
It's evolved...

00:00:51.830 --> 00:00:54.080
Wh-what is it doing?!

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:56.790
No... It's...

00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:01.210
Aria!

00:01:02.830 --> 00:01:04.710
A spirit...

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:12.250
Are they usually this creepy?!

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:16.290
Aria, I've missed you! I've missed you!

00:01:16.460 --> 00:01:19.000
Let us be joined as well.

00:01:19.210 --> 00:01:21.960
Let me devour you.

00:01:39.630 --> 00:01:44.130
Tarinai mono sagashi utsumuitara

00:01:44.130 --> 00:01:47.830
Konna suteki na basho ni deaenai

00:01:49.710 --> 00:01:54.080
Aimai na monosashi wa mou shimaou

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:59.130
Yuuki ga ichimen hirogaru kara

00:01:59.420 --> 00:02:04.670
Hitomi ni wa uso no nai ima ga utsutte

00:02:04.670 --> 00:02:08.880
Iranai tsuyogari o sutete

00:02:09.040 --> 00:02:13.500
Issho ni naki egao ni narou

00:02:13.670 --> 00:02:19.540
Hajiite sorezore no speed de suki na you ni kazatta

00:02:19.880 --> 00:02:24.500
Kimi ga ireba kiseki mo okiru RE-ILLUSION

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:27.210
Terashiai kagayaite

00:02:27.210 --> 00:02:31.960
Sono saki de yume to yume mazariatte

00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:34.170
Soujou kouka o unde

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:41.880
Shoushin shoumei no katai kizuna de sekai watatta

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:55.460
How could that thing be a spirit?

00:02:55.460 --> 00:02:58.040
A bit different from how
I remember them in the story books.

00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:01.670
So this was all a means to funnel power into that being...

00:03:02.830 --> 00:03:09.170
Which means those new species were created
only to be a food source of Magic Stones and energy.

00:03:10.130 --> 00:03:13.670
This oughta be good. The evolution of a spirit, huh?

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:19.540
Aria, go to Level 59.

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:22.750
There, you should find the answer to what you seek.

00:03:23.170 --> 00:03:25.960
This is the answer Miss Ais was meant to find?

00:03:26.420 --> 00:03:28.380
Aria! Aria!

00:03:28.380 --> 00:03:31.000
I've been waiting for you, waiting for so long!

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:34.710
Come, let me devour you!

00:03:36.210 --> 00:03:37.040
The path!

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:38.420
Everyone, prepare for combat!

00:03:38.580 --> 00:03:40.750
Finn, I'm heading to the front too!

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:43.830
Doesn't change anything. This bitch is goin' down!

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:46.040
Are you ready, Ais?

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:53.790
Proud warriors. Archers of the forest...

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:02.170
It's dense!

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:03.000
And fast!
It's dense!

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:06.540
Finn, I'll back you up!

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:09.630
I'll torch those vines and get you in close to the-

00:04:09.630 --> 00:04:10.830
Wait!

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:15.080
My thumb won't stop tingling... something is coming!

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:17.040
Earth, roar...

00:04:18.380 --> 00:04:18.960
An incantation?!

00:04:19.290 --> 00:04:23.330
Come, come, come, shell of the Earth.

00:04:23.330 --> 00:04:26.580
Shining sparks of black iron. Hammer of the stars.

00:04:26.580 --> 00:04:29.960
Negate the pact of creation.

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:32.250
A monster chanting?! That's not possible!

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:34.250
A Greater Incantation?

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:37.540
Riveria, get us under a barrier!

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:41.040
Raul, Lefiya, Tsubaki, stop that incantation!

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:42.330
Y-yes, Sir!

00:04:43.080 --> 00:04:46.960
Dance, spirit of the atmosphere, Lord of Light.

00:04:46.960 --> 00:04:49.460
Make your vow with the guardian of the forest...

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:53.380
Fusillade Fallarica!

00:04:58.500 --> 00:04:59.210
No way...

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:06.920
It had no effect at all?!

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:08.290
Don't falter! Keep at it!

00:05:08.290 --> 00:05:09.420
Y-yes, Sir!

00:05:12.380 --> 00:05:16.710
Scorch the sky, crack the earth, build a bridge to the Heavens.

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:20.000
Rain down your axes from the sky, calamity of destruction.

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:23.630
Envelop us in the songs of the Earth, let them surround us.

00:05:23.830 --> 00:05:26.210
I command thee in the name of the Agents.

00:05:26.210 --> 00:05:28.580
The Name bestowed upon me, Gnome,

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:31.580
Avatar of the Earth, Queen of the Earth!

00:05:31.710 --> 00:05:35.210
Light of the forest, become a great barrier and protect us.

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:36.790
My name is Alf!

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:39.210
Everyone, fall back under Riveria's barrier!

00:05:39.460 --> 00:05:41.040
Meteor Swarm!

00:05:41.170 --> 00:05:42.460
Via Shilheim!

00:05:48.170 --> 00:05:49.420
The barrier!

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:51.130
Hold fast, Riveria!

00:05:51.130 --> 00:05:52.330
I'm trying!

00:06:04.170 --> 00:06:06.210
Is it over?

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:10.210
So this is the power of a spirit...

00:06:10.460 --> 00:06:14.290
Damn hag thinks she can take us down.
I'm comin' for you this time!

00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:15.080
Wait, Bete.

00:06:15.330 --> 00:06:16.290
What?

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:18.920
Something else is coming.

00:06:23.290 --> 00:06:24.630
Come, fire...

00:06:24.790 --> 00:06:26.080
Consecutive Chanting?!

00:06:26.420 --> 00:06:28.210
Burn, burn, burn, vortex of flame, walls of crimson.

00:06:28.210 --> 00:06:31.290
Howls of Hellfire, use the strength of the tempest to close off the world.

00:06:31.290 --> 00:06:33.170
Burning sky, burning earth, burning sea, burning fountain,
burning mountain, burning life.

00:06:33.170 --> 00:06:34.420
She's fast!
Turn all to ash and loose the signal flare of hatred
and despair in exchange for the hero's life.

00:06:34.420 --> 00:06:35.250
Again already?!

00:06:35.250 --> 00:06:37.540
Right after casting such a powerful spell?!

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:39.080
I command thee in the name of the Agents.

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:45.330
The name bestowed upon me, Salamander,
Avatar of Flame, Queen of Flame!

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:46.250
Look out!

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:49.630
Fire Storm!

00:06:54.880 --> 00:06:55.920
Miss Riveria!

00:06:58.920 --> 00:07:01.540
Gareth! Protect Ais and the others!

00:07:03.670 --> 00:07:04.290
Rive-

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:12.580
Old Man!

00:07:17.630 --> 00:07:20.710
You're not getting through me!

00:07:51.540 --> 00:07:54.420
Riveria... Gareth...

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:13.790
It's absorbing the magical energy...

00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:16.830
The pests are back.

00:08:19.380 --> 00:08:20.290
Th-they're coming from behind us too!

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:44.830
We will defeat this monster!

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:47.130
I ask for your courage!

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:50.210
What do your eyes see?

00:08:50.710 --> 00:08:54.500
Fear? Despair? Destruction?

00:08:55.540 --> 00:08:59.880
My eyes see only an enemy I must defeat.
I see only victory!

00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:02.710
Retreat was never an option.

00:09:03.210 --> 00:09:05.540
With this spear, I will carve a path through!

00:09:06.420 --> 00:09:11.290
I swear in the name of the Prum goddess Fianna,
we will have victory!

00:09:12.830 --> 00:09:13.670
Follow me!

00:09:14.210 --> 00:09:19.420
Or is the weight of only mimicking Bell Cranel
too much for you to bear?

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:28.830
Tch! Like I'd lose to that small fry!

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:30.790
Excellent.

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:33.250
We've got our own adventuring to do.

00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:36.880
Bell Cranel...

00:09:43.630 --> 00:09:46.080
Raul, Tsubaki, support the rear!

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:47.710
The rest of you, come with me!

00:09:47.960 --> 00:09:49.460
Lefiya, you too!

00:09:49.460 --> 00:09:50.460
Right!

00:09:59.330 --> 00:10:01.750
Riveria, Gareth...

00:10:02.170 --> 00:10:03.420
Is this to be your end?

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:08.040
Rest now. I'll take it from here.

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:13.000
Let's go!

00:10:19.630 --> 00:10:22.830
Damn that cocky little Prum.

00:10:22.830 --> 00:10:25.880
Oy, you disagreeable Elf.

00:10:25.880 --> 00:10:27.920
You gonna sleep all day?

00:10:29.630 --> 00:10:32.920
Shut up, you Dwarf savage.

00:10:33.130 --> 00:10:37.330
Will you ever lose that glib tongue of yours?

00:10:37.330 --> 00:10:39.130
Riveria! Gareth!

00:10:39.380 --> 00:10:41.420
Raul, my axe!

00:10:41.580 --> 00:10:42.460
Yes, Sir!

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:44.790
I'll begin my incantation!

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:46.630
Tsubaki, cover me!

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:49.790
Of course!

00:10:59.830 --> 00:11:01.790
I'll be at your aid.

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:06.130
Ais, gather up all of your strength!
You're going to finish this in one final blow.

00:11:06.130 --> 00:11:10.210
The rest of us will do whatever we can
to create an opening for you to strike!

00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:12.040
I'll attack with everything I've got.

00:11:12.040 --> 00:11:15.920
Demonic spear, pierce my brow and take this blood offering!

00:11:16.830 --> 00:11:18.250
Hell Finegas!

00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:25.920
Follow the Boss!

00:11:29.920 --> 00:11:31.500
Come, fire.

00:11:31.630 --> 00:11:33.000
Here comes another spell!

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:34.080
Gods dammit!

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:36.630
Burn, burn, burn, vortex of flame, walls of crimson.

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:39.130
Howls of Hellfire, use the strength of the tempest to close off the world.

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:41.750
Burning sky, burning earth, burning sea,
burning fountain, burning mountain, burning life.

00:11:41.750 --> 00:11:44.790
Turn all to ash and loose the signal flare of hatred
and despair in exchange for the hero's life.

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:53.420
Now!

00:11:57.210 --> 00:11:58.960
Plunge forward, spear of thunder.

00:11:58.960 --> 00:12:04.170
My Name is Tonitrus.
Avatar of Thunder, Queen of Thunder.

00:12:04.460 --> 00:12:05.750
A short incantation?!

00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:07.420
Thunder Ray!

00:12:08.130 --> 00:12:11.330
Be thine shield! Holy grail of light! Dio Grail!

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:18.750
Lefiya!

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:20.540
Pull through it!

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:23.080
I need to catch up.

00:12:24.630 --> 00:12:27.630
So... I can do this...

00:12:28.210 --> 00:12:30.880
I can do this!

00:12:33.830 --> 00:12:34.710
Nice one!

00:12:39.420 --> 00:12:42.290
Storm of snow, three bitter winters.

00:12:42.290 --> 00:12:45.830
Advent of death. The flames will soon be unleashed!

00:12:47.080 --> 00:12:48.210
They're still coming!

00:12:48.210 --> 00:12:50.380
I think it's time for an upgrade.

00:12:53.880 --> 00:12:57.960
M-Miss Tsubaki, dual-wielding
two heavy weapons... it's too dangerous!

00:12:57.960 --> 00:12:59.040
Nonsense!

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:03.580
I'm a smith. I've been testing out
weapons like this my whole life!

00:13:06.960 --> 00:13:08.380
She's serious...

00:13:08.580 --> 00:13:12.000
Scorch them, Sword of Surtr! My name is Alf!

00:13:14.750 --> 00:13:16.080
Rea Laevateinn!

00:13:22.380 --> 00:13:23.330
Riveria.

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:28.250
You have your path...

00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:30.540
Now go!

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:38.880
Burn in hell!

00:13:44.500 --> 00:13:46.960
Come on! Hit like you mean it, Finn!

00:13:47.830 --> 00:13:48.880
Old Man!

00:13:48.880 --> 00:13:49.790
What took you so long?

00:13:50.210 --> 00:13:51.500
I don't have to ask, do I?

00:13:51.710 --> 00:13:53.000
Not a word out of you!

00:13:53.420 --> 00:13:55.670
Out of the way, you damn vines!

00:14:04.750 --> 00:14:07.040
Is that all you've got?!

00:14:07.500 --> 00:14:08.670
Go!

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:20.580
Ais, now!

00:14:20.790 --> 00:14:22.540
Aria!

00:14:23.330 --> 00:14:25.210
My name is not Aria.

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:27.670
I don't know who you are,

00:14:28.290 --> 00:14:30.920
but I can't let you exist here.

00:14:31.540 --> 00:14:32.830
That much I do know!

00:14:40.330 --> 00:14:42.130
Icicle Edge!

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:54.080
Miss... Ais...

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:58.960
Unleash a streak of light, bow and arrow of the holy tree.

00:14:58.960 --> 00:15:01.330
There's someone I have to reach...
Unleash a streak of light, bow and arrow of the holy tree.

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:02.540
Unleash a streak of light, bow and arrow of the holy tree.

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:05.670
Right now, I can't reach her
no matter how far I stretch out my hand.
Thou art master of the bow.

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:07.210
Thou art master of the bow.

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:07.830
But I know... someday I will...
Thou art master of the bow.

00:15:07.830 --> 00:15:09.000
But I know... someday I will...

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:11.080
But I know... someday I will...
Fire, O Elven archer. May your arrow strike true!

00:15:11.080 --> 00:15:13.210
Fire, O Elven archer. May your arrow strike true!

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:15.250
Arcs Ray!

00:15:22.580 --> 00:15:24.500
Icicle Edge!

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:29.040
Lefiya?!

00:15:52.080 --> 00:15:53.040
Tempest!

00:15:53.880 --> 00:15:57.130
Flash of light, pierce through. Slash apart the darkness.

00:15:57.250 --> 00:16:01.920
My Name is Lux. Avatar of Light, Queen of Light!

00:16:02.250 --> 00:16:03.630
I won't be defeated by you...

00:16:05.460 --> 00:16:06.040
Ais!

00:16:06.210 --> 00:16:07.000
Do it!

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:08.080
Come on!

00:16:08.290 --> 00:16:09.330
Tear it up!

00:16:09.330 --> 00:16:10.170
You can do this.

00:16:10.710 --> 00:16:12.130
Miss Ais.

00:16:12.380 --> 00:16:14.080
...because my friends are by my side!

00:16:14.290 --> 00:16:15.710
Light Burst!

00:16:16.580 --> 00:16:20.000
LIL LAFARGA!

00:16:27.960 --> 00:16:28.750
Miss Ais!

00:16:47.710 --> 00:16:49.130
Ais!

00:16:49.670 --> 00:16:52.290
You were brilliant, Loki Familia.

00:16:52.290 --> 00:16:53.580
Thanks.

00:16:53.880 --> 00:16:57.830
I witnessed something great today.

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:14.790
Ohayou mado o akete

00:17:14.790 --> 00:17:18.250
Doko e datte ikerunda

00:17:18.250 --> 00:17:22.130
Kibou wa itsumo sasayaita

00:17:22.130 --> 00:17:26.130
Doko made mo aruitekou

00:17:26.250 --> 00:17:32.880
Narabete kurabete tameiki tsuite

00:17:32.880 --> 00:17:39.210
Wakatteru wakatteru

00:17:40.710 --> 00:17:47.790
Yasashisa to ka nukumori to ka

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:51.500
Kimi datte ano ko datte

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:58.210
Itsuka kitto ai o shirunda

00:17:58.210 --> 00:18:05.290
Asu no kimi ga kyou no kimi o

00:18:05.540 --> 00:18:08.880
Omoide ni kaete

00:18:08.880 --> 00:18:13.080
Oikoshite susundeku

00:18:13.250 --> 00:18:20.130
Ame ga yande kao o agete

00:18:20.130 --> 00:18:26.080
"Arigatou" tte sunao ni waraeru hazu sa

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:29.540
Hello hello hello

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:38.330
Dareka no tame ai o utaou

00:18:39.710 --> 00:18:44.170
So, are you saying that monster
was the fallen shadow of a spirit?

00:18:44.710 --> 00:18:47.210
Or the offshoot of one, more accurately.

00:18:47.460 --> 00:18:50.380
I believe its true form lies in an even deeper level.

00:18:50.630 --> 00:18:54.630
This appears to have been placed there as support...

00:18:54.830 --> 00:18:58.080
To guard a far more powerful entity.

00:18:58.540 --> 00:19:03.960
In ancient times, spirits were those blessed with
the will of the gods, who aided the heroes of old...

00:19:03.960 --> 00:19:07.130
The so-called offshoots of the gods, were they not?

00:19:07.380 --> 00:19:10.500
This spirit's existence was surely turned inside out,

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:13.080
subsumed by a monster
while still maintaining its own identity.

00:19:13.330 --> 00:19:17.080
Consumed by the primal impulse of survival:
eat or be eaten.

00:19:17.080 --> 00:19:19.290
A corrupted spirit, as it were.

00:19:19.790 --> 00:19:22.380
So it's been alive for more than a thousand years?

00:19:25.170 --> 00:19:31.130
And those new species of monsters and creatures...
the products of that corrupted spirit as well?

00:19:32.290 --> 00:19:34.040
The irony of it all.

00:19:34.670 --> 00:19:41.750
A spirit who was once sent here to save mankind
now threatens the whole of Orario.

00:19:42.250 --> 00:19:44.250
The problem does not end there...

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:49.210
Its accomplice... Or rather, its leader.

00:19:49.330 --> 00:19:50.790
Enyo.

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:55.250
The one who will wipe Orario off the face of the Earth.

00:19:55.960 --> 00:19:58.040
The Destroyer of Cities...

00:20:06.170 --> 00:20:08.420
Ah... they took it down.

00:20:08.750 --> 00:20:10.920
Aria is a powerful one, indeed.

00:20:14.920 --> 00:20:17.250
Hush. Be still.

00:20:18.170 --> 00:20:21.080
I'll devour her before she gets very far.

00:20:22.670 --> 00:20:25.040
Wait for me, Aria...

00:20:27.250 --> 00:20:30.330
The Loki Familia has returned from their expedition.

00:20:30.960 --> 00:20:36.540
They traversed 58 levels until finally reaching 59.

00:20:37.080 --> 00:20:40.960
And your dear companion
came back safely, did she not?

00:20:40.960 --> 00:20:44.290
Y-you mean... Lefiya?

00:20:44.670 --> 00:20:48.420
Yes. All participants returned safely.

00:20:48.750 --> 00:20:52.290
It wouldn't hurt to show a bit more joy, then, would it?

00:21:04.420 --> 00:21:07.040
I see...

00:21:07.290 --> 00:21:12.080
So it was a corrupted spirit
that was waitin' for ya on Level 59.

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:13.330
That's right.

00:21:13.330 --> 00:21:16.670
It's clear now why the enemy
has been so focused on Ais.

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:21.750
Because the blood that flows through her veins
is descended from spirits.

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:24.790
And it wants to devour her, huh?

00:21:24.790 --> 00:21:28.080
For being as difficult as she is,
she sure gets targeted a lot.

00:21:28.080 --> 00:21:29.920
We're in a real mess, huh?

00:21:30.460 --> 00:21:33.210
Baby Ais belongs with us!

00:21:33.460 --> 00:21:35.880
I know another difficult person in this room right now...

00:21:37.250 --> 00:21:40.670
So, whaddya think these guys are really after?

00:21:41.670 --> 00:21:44.130
They'll send monsters to the surface,

00:21:44.130 --> 00:21:49.040
turn those orbs into more parasites and feed on their
Magic Stones until another one of its offshoots emerges.

00:21:49.040 --> 00:21:49.880
In other words...

00:21:50.130 --> 00:21:52.460
They're summoning spirits to the surface.

00:21:52.710 --> 00:21:54.630
And not just one at a time, either.

00:21:54.790 --> 00:21:58.830
If that comes to pass, Orario will surely fall to ruin.

00:22:00.420 --> 00:22:03.250
Come on, now's not the time to despair.

00:22:04.210 --> 00:22:06.790
All we have to do is prevent that from happening.

00:22:09.080 --> 00:22:12.000
We've got some promising youngsters
on our side as well.

00:22:14.210 --> 00:22:17.580
Lefiya, I want to thank you for what you did back there.

00:22:18.040 --> 00:22:22.960
If it weren't for your magic,
none of us would have come back here alive.

00:22:22.960 --> 00:22:26.630
I-it was luck! I just happened to be there at the right time!

00:22:26.960 --> 00:22:33.540
I only wanted to... to catch up to you, so...

00:22:36.250 --> 00:22:37.830
Um, Miss Ais?

00:22:39.130 --> 00:22:41.830
From here on out, could I always, always...

00:22:44.380 --> 00:22:45.920
...always follow you?

00:22:48.540 --> 00:22:49.830
Of course you can.

00:22:49.830 --> 00:22:52.040
Th-thank you!

00:22:56.420 --> 00:22:59.000
This isn't a dream, for once it's actually real!

00:22:59.000 --> 00:23:00.790
Ais? Lefiya?!

00:23:01.920 --> 00:23:03.420
What are you two doin' over there?

00:23:03.420 --> 00:23:05.540
O-oh, we were just...

00:23:05.750 --> 00:23:06.960
No fair!

00:23:06.960 --> 00:23:07.710
Let me in!

00:23:07.710 --> 00:23:10.330
Lookie! A heavenly harem!

00:23:10.580 --> 00:23:13.790
Lemme in on this, girls!

00:23:19.250 --> 00:23:20.380
H-huh?

00:23:20.380 --> 00:23:21.960
You did it, Lefiya!

00:23:21.960 --> 00:23:23.210
You've grown so much!

00:23:23.210 --> 00:23:26.170
Oh, but I just... reacted...
